X: 1
T: Adiu paure Carnaval
O: Traditional Occitan, Provence
N: The song sung at the burning of Carnival on Mardi Gras evening, when the
N: straw effigy is tried, condemned and set alight before Lent begins.
N: Melody and score from mamalisa.com (Monique Palomares), transposed up a fifth.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=108
M: 3/4
K: Bm
